        Interfaces
        <span>Typography · Interaction · Systems</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="discipline__body">
        <p>
          Editorial interfaces for technical products. Typography, grid, state, and
          interaction are treated as part of the system rather than a skin over it.
          The goal is not decoration; it is legibility under pressure.
        </p>
        <ul>
